    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 58 Árd na Mara presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and beautifully positioned detached bungalow with attic conversion, ideally located within a mature and highly regarded residential development in the sought-after seaside village of Blackrock, Co. Louth.\n\nExtending to approximately 179 sq.m. / 1,926 sq.ft., this substantial home offers well-proportioned and versatile accommodation, making it particularly well suited to modern family living. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, kitchen/dining room, generous living room, family room, four bedrooms (one ensuite) and a main bathroom. The converted attic space at first floor provides valuable additional accommodation and could readily suit a variety of uses.\n\nExternally, the property occupies an attractive and private site, with a generous lawn and off-street parking to the front, while the rear garden offers a pleasant outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining. \n\nÁrd na Mara is a mature and highly sought-after residential development, ideally positioned within easy reach of the heart of Blackrock Village. With its enviable coastal setting overlooking Dundalk Bay, Blackrock has long been regarded as one of County Louth's most desirable residential locations and offers an exceptional quality of life for both families and those seeking a peaceful seaside setting.\n\nThe village itself boasts a wonderful selection of amenities, with Blackrock Promenade and Beach providing an attractive backdrop for leisurely walks, sea swimming and outdoor activities. The village is home to a selection of restaurants, gourmet cafés and independent artisan outlets, while local amenities also include two primary schools, Blackrock Park, GAA and football clubs, Dundalk Golf Club and a Community Centre offering a wide range of activities and recreational facilities for all age groups.\n\nThe location also benefits from excellent accessibility, with the M1 Motorway providing convenient access to both Dublin & Belfast city. Dundalk Town is only a short drive away and provides an extensive range of further amenities and services, including Dundalk Institute of Technology, Marshes Shopping Centre, Dundalk Retail Park, IDA Business & Technology Parks and the MSD / WuXi Pharmaceutical facility. \n\nCombining generous accommodation, a versatile layout, an attractive site and an enviable coastal location, No. 58 Árd na Mara represents an excellent opportunity to acquire an extensive home in one of the areas most popular residential developments.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this impressive home has to offer."
      },
